# Verification gate

This repo has no ESLint script. The gate is TypeScript + Vitest.

After any code edit, before continuing or claiming done:

```bash
npm run check
```

After a behavioral change (logic, webhook, tools, agent, remediation, store, sentry):

```bash
npm run check && npm test
```

Rules:

- Do not mark work complete until the gate passes.
- Prefer unit tests with injected mocks (`fetchImpl`, store, AI). No live Workers AI or network in tests.
- Assert business-rule outcomes (severity, escalation, waitUntil scheduling, remediation eligibility), not console formatting.
- If the gate fails, fix the failure before starting unrelated work.
